* Higher professional education (HBO+) level of working and thinking, with at least a completed Bachelor’s degree in Finance or a real-estate-related field;
* At least six years’ experience in a relevant environment;
* Experience working on projects;
* Knowledge of and experience using and configuring project administration software;
* Proficiency in Microsoft Office, SharePoint and Power BI, and in working with large datasets for financial modelling;
* Experience working in complex and changing environments;
